        "quote": "(a) In consideration of the benefits to be derived by the City and its inhabitants, there is hereby granted to the company (said company operating a distribution system in the State of Kansas), a non-exclusive franchise for a period of 20 years from the effective date, to construct, maintain, extend and operate its distribution facilities along, across, upon or under any public way; for the purpose of selling and distributing natural gas for all purposes to the City, and its inhabitants, and through said City and beyond the limits thereof; to obtain said natural gas, and/or comparable blends of combustible gasses, from any source available; and to do all things necessary or proper to carry on said business.",
